<title>SWEDEN: Volvo Aero in talks with Daimler-Benz.</title>
<headline>Volvo Aero in talks with Daimler-Benz.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish automotive group Volvo's Aero division said on Tuesday it was discussing project cooperation with Daimler-Benz's MTU unit regarding jet engine components.</p>
</text>
